SRR3106023	PRJNA309152	SRP068576	SAMN04421051	SRX1534368	Mus musculus	E12.5 female Tet1-KO PGC RRBS Replicate 2	E12.5 female Tet1-KO PGC RRBS Replicate 2	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM2041504: E12.5 female Tet1-KO PGC RRBS Replicate 2 Mus musculus Bisulfite-Seq	Bisulfite-Seq	GENOMIC	Reduced Representation	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	Total DNA from FACS-sorted PGCs isolated from individual Tet1-KO or wild type embryos was isolated using ZR-Duet DNA-RNA MiniPrep kit (Zymo), and DNA from between two to six embryos (equivalent to 1,000 to 8,000 cells) of the same genotype, stage and sex was pooled and concentrated to 26 µL final volume using the Savant SpeedVac Concentrator (Thermo) and following the manufacturer’s instructions. Genomic DNA was digested by 20 units of MspI enzyme (NEB) in NEB buffer 2 at 37°C for 3 hrs, and digested DNA was purified using AMPure XP beads (Beckman-Coulter). Libraries were made following the NEBNext Ultra DNA Library Prep protocol, with the following modifications: 1) methylated adaptors were diluted 1:10 in nuclease free H2O to a final concentration of 1.5 µM 2) following adaptor ligation, bisulphite conversion was carried out using the Imprint Modification Kit (Sigma), and following the two step protocol according to the manufacturer’s specifications and 3) PCR enrichment was carried out for 18 cycles using the KAPA Uracil+ DNA polymerase master mix (KAPA Biosystems) and the NEBNext Library Prep universal and index primers (NEB). The libraries were purified by AMPure XP beads (Beckman-Coulter). Pooled libraries were sequenced on the Illumina HiSeq 2000 instrument.	21769800	2176980000	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR310/003/SRR3106023/SRR3106023.fastq.gz	471b0b762cb1a687fb70821d80227e0f	1141320694
